<title>USA: Poore Brothers names Kufel CEO, president.</title>
<headline>Poore Brothers names Kufel CEO, president.</headline>
<dateline>GOODYEAR, Ariz. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poore Brothers Inc said Tuesday it had named Eric Kufel as president and chief executive, succeeding David Brennan, who will continue as a director.</p>
<p>Kufel was formerly senior brand manager for Purex Laundry Detergent at Dial Corp.</p>
<p>Kufel's appointment is effective February 3. He will also serve on the company's board, Poore Brothers said.</p>
